Title: Neon Courier - Episode 2 "Red Thread"

INT. JUNO'S APARTMENT - NIGHT

Mira searches her sister's room. She finds Juno's red scarf and wraps it around her neck over the black jacket.

MIRA
I'll bring it back to you myself.

EXT. SKYBRIDGE - NIGHT

Mira and Kai ride the motorbike across the bridge. Voss drones swarm. A missile hits the bike. Mira and Kai leap clear as the motorbike explodes and falls into the canal.

KAI
That was your bike.

MIRA
That was my everything.

EXT. OLD BROADCAST TOWER - LATER

A strange signal pulses from the abandoned tower, spelling Mira's name in Morse code.

KAI
Someone out there knows you.

SMASH TO BLACK.
